<title>USA: IDEXX names CFO, acquires Acumedia.</title>
<headline>IDEXX names CFO, acquires Acumedia.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBROOK, Maine 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDEXX Laboratories Inc said Tuesday that Ralph Carlton had joined the company as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Carlton was previously a senior vice-president at Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette in New York.</p>
<p>The CFO post had been vacant since 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>IDEXX also said that it had acquired Acumedia Manufacturers, Inc, a company specilizing in microbiological culture media, for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>The company has also entered into an agreement with Fuisz Technologies to commercialize Fuisz's rapid dissolve tablet technology.</p>
